---
title: "member_deletion_cascade (stem-bot-v2: table.sql)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_trigger: DELETE from auth.users(id) OR DELETE member.members
    q_trigger --> q_cascade_relations: ON DELETE CASCADE triggered
    q_cascade_relations --> q_delete_team_rels: DELETE member_team_relations WHERE member_id = id
    q_cascade_relations --> q_delete_leader_rels: DELETE team_leaders WHERE member_id = id
    q_delete_team_rels --> q_check_auth_cascade: team relations removed
    q_delete_leader_rels --> q_check_auth_cascade: leader relations removed
    q_check_auth_cascade --> q_delete_member: CASCADE from auth.users deletes member row
    q_delete_member --> [*]: member fully removed with all relations

    note right of q_cascade_relations
        INV-001: Deleting auth.users row cascades to member.members
        INV-002: Deleting member.members cascades to member_team_relations
        INV-003: Deleting member.members cascades to team_leaders
        INV-004: All FK references use ON DELETE CASCADE (no orphan records)
    end note
